 "requests": {
  "en": "Plan our Jaipur trip: my parents and I are flying from Kolkata on 18 December and coming back on 20 December.\nFor the flight there, take the cheapest non-stop flight that leaves before 11 am.\nFor the return, take the earliest non-stop flight after 3 pm.\nKeep all six flight tickets together within \u20b939,000.\nBook the highest-rated hotel within 3 km of Hawa Mahal that serves a pure-veg breakfast and whose rooms start at no more than \u20b93,500 a night.\nTake a twin room for my parents and a single room for me.\nBook a sedan to pick us up at Jaipur airport when we land and take us to the hotel.\nOn the 19th, get Nahargarh Fort tickets for the first slot after 12 noon - senior-citizen tickets for my parents and a student ticket for me.\nOn every flight Papa and I want window seats and Mummy wants an aisle seat. Meals: vegetarian for me, Jain for Mummy, lacto-vegetarian for Papa."
 },
